  "bodyHtml": "\n\t\n\t<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-image-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-title-date no-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Annual Members Dinner</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tecset-date\"><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">September 13, 2023 @ 5:00 pm</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">9:00 pm</span></div>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-light-bg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-content-area\">\n\t\t   \t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>Guild members are invited to our Annual Members Dinner (with guest) to be held <strong>Wednesday, September 13th, at 400 East Restaurant, East Harwich</strong>.  We have reserved the special function room so acoustics will not be an issue.  Price fixed buffet with cash bar.  Reception will be held at 5pm followed by dinner.  <strong>Information on menu, cost and reservations will be forthcoming. </strong></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-map-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-area\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-past-event-notice\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-notices\"><ul><li>This event has passed.</li></ul></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-group-details\">\n\t<h2 class=\"tribe-events-single-section-title\"> Details </h2>\n\t<ul class=\"tribe-events-meta-list\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-meta-item\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-start-date-label tribe-events-meta-label\">Date:</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-meta-value\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<abbr class=\"tribe-events-abbr tribe-events-start-date published dtstart\" title=\"2023-09-13\"> September 13, 2